{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/app/abstract-services","title":"Abstract services","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"abstract-services","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Abstract services"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"An "},{"t":"code","text":"abstract"},{"t":"text","text":" service declares a "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"contract"}]},{"t":"text","text":" with no implementation, and forces"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"a concrete one to be supplied downstream. This is what makes a service's"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"implementation a decision of the mounting site — a route, a feature config, a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"test — instead of a hard import."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"abstract-requirements","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Abstract Requirements"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Use "},{"t":"code","text":"providedIn: 'abstract'"},{"t":"text","text":" to declare a contract that must be implemented elsewhere."}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { abstract, craftService } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/core'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"type","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"CounterContract","kind":"type"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  ()","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":":","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"number","kind":"type"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"increment","kind":"function"},{"text":"()","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":":","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"void","kind":"type"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"};","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { ",